ache medication that  combined cocoa leaves and Kola nuts he'd  been selling a drink for five cents a  glass at his own drugstore it was  created in his backyard in a  three-legged fifteen gallon pot that  stood over a fire and when Cantler  sampled it he was immediately hooked  and what appeared to be a rash decision  to onlookers Kenley decided at once to  sell his entire stock of drugs paints  oils glass and fancy clothes he sold off  everything he could and raised roughly  $50,000 he initially invested five  hundred dollars in Pemberton's company  but by the end of 1891 he had managed  the ink control over the entire  coca-cola product for just twenty three  hundred dollars he use the rest of the  money to continue manufacturing and  marketing the drink coca-cola was born  action that I'm number one make people  remember your product many entrepreneurs  think that if they build a great product  sales would take care of themselves the  fact is an average product with great  sales and marketing will always help  perform an excellent product with no  sales and marketing you need to get the  word out about what you're doing or have  someone on your team do it for you  before Candler took over coca-cola  operations Pemberton had been doing  business on a small scale here at a  local company with a local customer base  and had little chances of growing up  much larger at the rate he was going his  only promotional effort was an aural  cloth with the sign drink coca-cola that  hung in the local drugstore Kayla  whoever knew that there were billions  more thirsty people out there he just  needed to find a way to reach them it  was through a strategy of aggressive and  memorable marketing initiated by canler  one which continues to this day  that coca-cola became the multi-billion  dollar company it is today according the  canler  I knew I had found something that other  people would want distributing coca-cola  through other pharmacies was a way to  reach more people I 